[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2703898864","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103693#issuecomment-2703898864","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103693","id":2703898864,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6hKjjw","user":{"login":"lawnjelly","id":21999379,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxOTk5Mzc5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21999379?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly","html_url":"https://github.com/lawnjelly","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-06T13:46:16Z","updated_at":"2025-03-06T13:49:00Z","body":"> Also, it is unclear to me whether dynamic_cast is used in any performance critical functions.\r\n\r\n`Object::cast_to` is used all over the shop, including traversing scene trees, so it should be fast.\r\n\r\nIn 3.x we have some alternate implementation on some platforms (Android, web looks like):\r\n```\r\n\ttemplate <class T>\r\n\tstatic const T *cast_to(const Object *p_object) {\r\n#ifndef NO_SAFE_CAST\r\n\t\treturn dynamic_cast<const T *>(p_object);\r\n#else\r\n\t\tif (!p_object)\r\n\t\t\treturn NULL;\r\n\t\tif (p_object->is_class_ptr(T::get_class_ptr_static()))\r\n\t\t\treturn static_cast<const T *>(p_object);\r\n\t\telse\r\n\t\t\treturn NULL;\r\n#endif\r\n\t}\r\n```","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2703898864/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2762063278","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103693#issuecomment-2762063278","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103693","id":2762063278,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6kob2u","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-28T17:57:16Z","updated_at":"2025-03-28T17:57:16Z","body":"Closing because this is probably not needed after #103708 has been merged.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2762063278/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]